Z||000003||TotalFiasco||07-02-2000||05:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by WisconsinGT:<BR><B>I am trying to take the black door handle area off. No problem except for the locking knob. Do I pry it loose or do I twist it off? Thanks</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey, i had to pry mine off allso, the damn thing was such a pain that i think i said a few colorful words in the process, i allso replaced the whole door skin after some punks ruined the original trying to steal my car, the process was very time consuming but i had fun with the plastic screws! the mirror has two nuts that are in a wild place this took some time to remove but after a few i finally got them off, it is a 10 mm,the plastic screws are #2Torx.   <BR>||||reg||14
